ACT XXI OF 2017
ACT XXI
OF 2017
SUKKUR
IBA UNIVERSITY ACT, 2017
An Act to provide for establishment the Sukkur IBA University at Sukkur
[Gazette
of Sindh Extraordinary, Part IV, 14th June, 2017]
No. PAS/LEGIS-B-14/2017, dated
14.6.2017.---The Sukkur IBA University Bill,
2017 having been passed by the Provincial Assembly of Sindh
on 15th May, 2017 and assented to by the Governor of Sindh
on 29th May, 2017 is hereby published as an Act of the Legislature of Sindh.
Preamble.---WHEREAS
it is expedient to provide for establishment the Sukkur
IBA University at Sukkur and to provide for matters
connected therewith or ancillary thereto;
CHAPTER-I
PRELIMINARY
2. Definitions.---In
this Act, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context -
(a) "Academic
Council" means the Academic Council of the University;
(b) "Affiliated
College" means an education institution affiliated to the University but
not maintained or administered by it;
(c) "Authority"
means any of the authorities of the University specified or setup under section
20;
(d) "Chairperson"
means the Chairperson of the Senate;
(e) "Chancellor"
means the Chancellor of the University;
(f) "College"
means the constituent college or affiliated College;
(g) "Commission"
means the Higher Education Commission set up by the Higher Education Commission
Ordinance, 2002;
(h) "Constituent
College" means an education institute, by whatever name described,
maintained and administered by the University;
(i) "Dean" means the head of a
faculty or the head of an academic body granted the status of a faculty by this
Act or by the Statutes or Regulations;
(j) Department
means a head teaching department maintained and administered or recognized by
the University in the manner prescribed;
(k) "Director"
means Head of Teaching Division or an Institute established as a constituent
institution by the University;
(l) "Educational
Institution" means an institution imparting instructions in a subject or
subjects relating to a Faculty;
(m) "Faculty"
means an administrative and academic unit of the University consisting of one
or more departments as prescribed;
(n) "Government"
means the Government of Sindh;
(o) "Head"
means the Head of the Teaching Department;
(p) "Officers"
means Officers of the University;
(q) "Prescribed"
means prescribed by the statutes, regulations or rules made under this Act;
(r) "Principal"
means the Head of a College;
(s) "Pro-Chancellor"
means Pro-Chancellor of the University;
(t) Pro-Vice
Chancellor" means the Pro-Vice Chancellor of the University;
(u) "Representation
Committees" means the representation committees constituted under section
27;
(v) "Search
Committee" means the Search Committee constituted under section 15(2);
(w) "Senate"
means the Senate of the University;
(x) "Statutes,
"Regulation" and Rules" means the statutes, regulations and
rules respectively made under this Act;
(y) "Syndicate"
means the Syndicate of the University; and
(z) "Teachers"
include Professors, Associate Professors, Assistant Professors and Lecturers
engaged whole time by the University or by the constituent or affiliated
college and such other person as may be declared to be teachers by regulations;
(aa) "University" means the Sukkur IBA University established under this Act;
(bb) "Vice
Chancellor" means Vice Chancelor of the University.
